# Agent Boundaries

- **No changes on `main`**: Never commit directly to `main`. Use `develop` or feature branches.
- **High-frequency granular commits**: Commit progress with high frequency. Each commit should not have more than 1 or 2 files. Commit incrementally as units and individual files finish.
- **Single-line commits**: Keep every commit message to exactly one line, brief and direct.
- **No co-authors**: Never add `Co-authored-by:` or assistant tags under any circumstances.
- **Feature directory organization**: Organize code using feature directories. Group related functions/logic inside feature folders so the tree is easy to navigate without inspecting file contents.
